{"version":1,"key":"card:549","content":{"id":549,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8e1ac8b2-1ca1-4a75-91e9-23d3de2fe6c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们都知道作用域的概念，它是指变量可访问范围。我们自然而然的会提出一个疑问，它是如何工作的，JavaScript 是如何判断变量是否可以访问的？对于嵌套场景下同名变量引用的值是如何区分的？答案是词法环境，JavaScript 引擎内部通过词法环境来跟踪和管理变量。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79f47b4b-4b56-491d-bb84-1c6b8dc1c9df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每次创建执行上下文时，都会创建变量环境和词法环境，变量环境和词法环境具有相同的数据结构，不过存储的是不同类型的变量，变量环境中存储的是 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":503,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":428,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"73b75abc-0314-452f-b27f-c35e0289efe5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"var"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量和声明在全局上下文顶层或函数顶层的函数，而词法环境存储的是 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":505,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":429,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"0c6db52c-6a26-49fb-9c08-c4ef6e9b361a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"let"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":507,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":430,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"ceef8920-c363-4195-9f41-10204503c3ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"const"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量、声明在非顶层的函数和类声明。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b1cfa5dc-3155-4601-b3ef-414d67038daa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在创建新的"},{"type":"content-link","refId":548,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":1349,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"a08ec4e4-6b49-4b16-9270-63b02e25a375","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"执行上下文"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"时，变量环境和词法环境都是一样的，如果创建了新的词法环境，词法环境会进行切换，而变量环境保持不变，所以在一个执行上下文中只有一个变量环境，但是可能存在多个词法环境。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"be955f51-cd34-4af1-8686-1155c26e0e9d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f09f5bea-ed3f-495d-9c5b-f6f841b31d60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量环境是为了兼容 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"var"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量的历史包袱，我觉得可以理解为变量环境和执行上下文顶层的词法环境是一样的，甚至可以看作是一个东西，这样就没有变量环境的概念了，也更容易理解。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8df456a0-6255-4a84-946b-dbfd94005560","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二者的数据结构如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"C++","uuid":"f512571a-e1c7-4384-b42a-b8fcd1095409","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c7166f42-51c3-4961-be0e-fe4ddb405d73","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"LexicalEnvironment = {\n  EnvironmentRecord: { \n    // 当前环境的变量存储\n  },\n  [[OuterEnv]]: <父级词法环境的引用>\n}","collabId":"0312db58-71ce-4f92-b1e1-af33f31e610a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a8aa1e90-6f7c-4f56-9aba-39ff6f65a1fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中包含两个部分："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d6ed162d-a15e-4558-9f86-58eef3a4544a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2c2e6de4-f149-4838-91eb-b1ad050e66f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a099ded-31f6-428d-9005-ac16205ec506","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[[OuterEnv]]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，外部词法环境引用，指向父级词法环境"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c09b46df-8f36-44aa-97c5-89d6a8a18dea","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5139698-0693-4ac2-9ead-76c73d624e2d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"EnvironmentRecord"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当前词法环境的变量存储"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"45b8f18f-6be5-43b9-855e-258b308b42fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在执行上下文的创建阶段，就通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[[OuterEnv]]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 建立好了作用域链，在执行阶段当我们访问变量时，首先会查看当前所在的词法环境中是否存在该变量，如果不存在，那么就根据 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[[OuterEnv]]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 存储的父词法环境中去寻找，以此类推，直到最外层的全局执行上下文中的词法环境，这个查询的链路就是变量的作用域链。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7537bde1-d5ed-4998-9f8a-6eb0517f724d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么情况下会产生新的词法环境："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"6cbfcb3a-e1c7-4c84-9a8c-404afa9451e5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"74bd71b0-d81f-4889-a3df-8b6ea4fba77e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","di